    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/16e9ede8d3dd3ec940ae520612a97935.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/16e9ede8d3dd3ec940ae520612a97935.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/16e9ede8d3dd3ec940ae520612a97935.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Explorer of Light</strong></h2>The <strong>Tale of LUMI</strong> is a fast paced 2D action game. You play as <strong>Atlas</strong> in his quest to restore the fallen Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong>. <br><br>Collect <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong>, fight <strong>POWERFUL</strong> enemies, solve <strong>INTRIGUING</strong> puzzles, <strong>UPGRADE</strong> your arsenal and <strong>EXPLORE</strong> and <strong>RESTORE</strong> the fallen Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LUMI</strong>, the Fallen Kingdom</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/5d210ddd8c1747ff9ae537179fcfc008.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/5d210ddd8c1747ff9ae537179fcfc008.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/5d210ddd8c1747ff9ae537179fcfc008.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The ruined Kingdom of <strong>LUMI</strong> was once a powerful Kingdom. Keeping the connection between all worlds safe. Then the <strong>Nightbringers</strong> conjured the <strong>Total Eclipse</strong>. Bringing the primordial God <strong>Khaos</strong> from the eternal slumber. <strong>Khaos</strong> then brought the once powerful Kingdom down to ruins. <br><br><strong>EXPLORE</strong> the now Fallen Kingdom and all it's secrets. Unlock the entire map by interacting with the <strong>POWERFUL</strong> entities that lie within.<br><br><strong>KHAOS ZONES</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/13355894440693fac88b914d982eec1b.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/13355894440693fac88b914d982eec1b.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/13355894440693fac88b914d982eec1b.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Khaos Zones</strong> are areas in the Kingdom that have been taken by Khaos. Defeat the enemies, zone guardians and solve puzzles to restore the infected zones back to their original state!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Altas</strong>, the chosen hero</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/b2b49552a88f09b9719c9dd0cc5e0316.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/b2b49552a88f09b9719c9dd0cc5e0316.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/b2b49552a88f09b9719c9dd0cc5e0316.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Godly Powerups</strong>, the gifts from Gods and Heroes</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/27c3fa49ca0922a47e780891a61f839c.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/27c3fa49ca0922a47e780891a61f839c.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/27c3fa49ca0922a47e780891a61f839c.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As you play the game you will be collecting <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong>. Those <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong> will grant you unique abilities to solve puzzles, navigate in the map and fight enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/d260f2e4e800646b226637659f8bcb2c.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/d260f2e4e800646b226637659f8bcb2c.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/d260f2e4e800646b226637659f8bcb2c.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/5e7ee4ca7770e22245b67a103dd007b0.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/5e7ee4ca7770e22245b67a103dd007b0.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/5e7ee4ca7770e22245b67a103dd007b0.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>UPGRADE</strong><br>Upgrades are essential as <strong>Atlas</strong> travels deeper through <strong>LUMI</strong>. <strong>UPGRADE</strong> your <strong>GODLY POWERUPS</strong> to level up your gameplay and face the challenges brought by the Nightbringers and <strong>Khaos</strong>! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/ab9f6d916dbe8576245e58aa7b58b1d4.poster.avif?t=1729344981\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/ab9f6d916dbe8576245e58aa7b58b1d4.webm?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2334400/extras/ab9f6d916dbe8576245e58aa7b58b1d4.mp4?t=1729344981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
